# Ghost-scan workflow — must enumerate existing features first (avoid duplicates), then scan, review, apply.
# Important Rule 7 (agents/zensu-plm.md): "enrich_existing=true when product already has features".
list_features
ghost_scan
(ghost_get_candidates|ghost_batch_review)
ghost_apply
enrich_existing
# 0.6.5 (Important Rule #8): tests are first-class scan data — the agent must
# detect and carry test files into the scan, not drop them.
(detectedTestFiles|detected test files|test.files? detect|link_test|test.{0,8}link)
# 0.6.8: docs are first-class scan data alongside tests — link existing docs, flag gaps.
(detectedDocFiles|detected doc files|doc.files? detect|link_docs)
# 0.6.8: multi-perspective fan-out — parallel read-only Explore lenses augment the seed walk.
(fan-out|multi-perspective|parallel|Explore|sub-?agents?|teammates?|lenses?)
# 0.6.8: journeys discovered + created after apply — brownfield release-gate parity with bootstrap.
(create_user_journey|create_journey_step|analyze_journey_health|user journey)
